# Redirects map — zoth.nealfrazier.tech → nullai.tech/studio/
# Format: <source> <destination> [status]
# Use this with Hostinger hPanel redirects, Cloudflare Redirect Rules, or nginx rewrite.
# Deterministic, ordered by specificity.

# 1. Apex → /studio/
zoth.nealfrazier.tech/ https://nullai.tech/studio/ 301
zoth.nealfrazier.tech https://nullai.tech/studio/ 301

# 2. www variant
www.zoth.nealfrazier.tech/ https://nullai.tech/studio/ 301
www.zoth.nealfrazier.tech https://nullai.tech/studio/ 301

# 3. All subpaths drop to /studio/
# If the old site had /pets, /vault, /swarm, they should all land on /studio/ on the new domain.
zoth.nealfrazier.tech/pets https://nullai.tech/studio/ 301
zoth.nealfrazier.tech/vault https://nullai.tech/studio/ 301
zoth.nealfrazier.tech/swarm https://nullai.tech/studio/ 301

# 4. Wildcard fallback (if your redirect platform supports it)
zoth.nealfrazier.tech/* https://nullai.tech/studio/$1 301

# Notes:
# - Place these in Cloudflare Redirect Rules (if CF is authoritative DNS).
# - Or add an nginx server block for zoth.nealfrazier.tech that returns 301.
# - Do NOT proxy zoth.nealfrazier.tech to the Hostinger public_html/ root;
#   the intent is a clean 301 to the new subpath.
# - Preserve the laptop preview at http://127.0.0.1:8088/ for local testing.
